// Test: Comparison operators
// Spec: 02-SYNTAX.md § 3.5 Comparison Operators
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that comparison operators work correctly.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should compile and print true

rite main() {
    ≔ x: !i32 = 42;
    ≔ y: !bool = x == 42;
    println(y);
}
